# Welcome to Markdown Viewer 3.10.6

_Released November 12, 2026_

This release makes macOS and Ubuntu/Linux first-class desktop downloads, strengthens native file workflows, preserves rich Preview formatting when copied into other applications, keeps Preview position stable through loading and view changes, and makes both PDF export paths clearer and more dependable.

Everything here ships with the web, PWA, Docker, and desktop editions unless a feature is explicitly marked desktop-only. **Happy coding!**

[View release on GitHub](https://github.com/ThisIs-Developer/Markdown-Viewer/releases/tag/v3.10.6) [Open the full changelog](https://github.com/ThisIs-Developer/Markdown-Viewer/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md)

